    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Bit manipulation</span><span class=\"chip accent\">XOR</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/single-number/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 136</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Single Number</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every value appears twice except one. XOR all of them: <code>x ^ x = 0</code>, <code>x ^ 0 = x</code>, and XOR does not care about order, so every pair cancels and the lonely value is what remains. O(n) time, O(1) space - the constraint that rules out the hash set.</p>\n"
  },
